WEBVTT

00:55.805 --> 00:57.724
Sunil High School's ace player,
Ryu Hyeong-jin.

00:57.807 --> 01:02.187
His record for this season is 6-0,
with the lowest ERA.

01:11.654 --> 01:13.198
The batter swings. A strikeout!

01:13.823 --> 01:16.076
- What's the situation?
- Two outs, bottom of the ninth.

01:16.159 --> 01:17.202
Tied five to five.

01:17.285 --> 01:18.578
Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:19.579 --> 01:21.372
What's this? Ryu Hyeong-jin?

01:21.456 --> 01:23.333
Is there something wrong?

01:24.000 --> 01:26.044
Did the screen just freeze?

01:26.711 --> 01:28.880
What's going on?

01:39.641 --> 01:41.226
She struck me hard.

01:50.235 --> 01:51.444
- Hi.
- Hello, sir.

01:51.528 --> 01:52.654
Hi.

01:52.737 --> 01:54.614
- Sir.
- Sir!

01:54.697 --> 01:57.158
- You changed your hair!
- Your face is glowing.

01:57.242 --> 01:58.243
You look so handsome.

01:58.326 --> 02:00.328
I obviously knew you were handsome.

02:01.079 --> 02:02.705
The classroom is that way.

02:02.789 --> 02:03.790
We know.

02:04.415 --> 02:06.292
- You look stunning.
- You look good.

02:06.376 --> 02:07.877
- Bye!
- See you later, sir!

02:15.802 --> 02:17.137
This is all thanks to Hee-kyung's…

02:18.513 --> 02:20.140
Ju-kyung's mom.

02:23.893 --> 02:25.103
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

02:30.525 --> 02:32.443
How could she not even call once

02:32.986 --> 02:34.737
during the time my brows have all set?

02:36.739 --> 02:38.074
Is a kiss meaningless to you?

02:38.992 --> 02:39.993
My lips aren't easy--

02:40.076 --> 02:41.661
- Hello?
- Good morning, sir.

02:41.744 --> 02:44.372
Hello? This is Han Jun-woo.

02:44.455 --> 02:45.665
Go lower.

02:45.748 --> 02:47.000
Keep your form.

02:47.709 --> 02:49.919
- Do it right.
- Good morning.

02:51.504 --> 02:53.590
Had the karaoke owner called the cops,

02:53.673 --> 02:56.092
you would have been transferred. Got it?

02:56.175 --> 02:57.886
Sir, it wasn't us!

02:57.969 --> 02:58.970
- Cho-rong!
- Cho-rong!

02:59.053 --> 03:01.764
Who else from our school
would fight in a karaoke room

03:01.848 --> 03:03.057
other than you punks?

03:03.850 --> 03:06.019
Bring them in if you can.

03:06.603 --> 03:07.687
It really wasn't us.

03:07.770 --> 03:09.772
- Jeez, we didn't do it.
- We swear it.

03:09.856 --> 03:11.274
Did I just hear "jeez"?

03:12.275 --> 03:13.359
It was me!

03:14.777 --> 03:17.030
I was in the fight.

03:17.572 --> 03:18.698
Seo-jun!

03:19.741 --> 03:21.701
I was going to call you in anyway.

03:21.784 --> 03:22.994
Come stand next to them.

03:23.077 --> 03:25.872
You punks always cause trouble together.

03:25.955 --> 03:27.081
Get into position!

03:27.916 --> 03:30.627
- Are you serious, Seo-jun?
- Don't look. It's embarrassing.

03:30.710 --> 03:31.878
Be quiet.

03:32.378 --> 03:34.130
- The group fight was us.
- That was us.

03:34.213 --> 03:35.882
- Excuse me?
- Guys!

03:35.965 --> 03:38.635
They say it's always the quiet ones,
but what were you thinking?

03:38.718 --> 03:40.720
Come stand next to them. Go on!

03:41.554 --> 03:42.388
Stand there.

03:43.056 --> 03:44.724
Get in position. Do it right!

03:45.642 --> 03:46.893
What were you all thinking?

03:47.769 --> 03:49.979
You all have serious issues.

03:51.648 --> 03:53.066
I was also in the fight.

03:54.317 --> 03:56.069
This is absolutely outrageous.

03:56.152 --> 03:57.528
My goodness.

03:58.196 --> 03:59.239
I started it.

04:00.323 --> 04:01.658
That group fight.

04:02.200 --> 04:04.035
Well done. You must be proud.

04:04.118 --> 04:06.371
Well!

04:08.873 --> 04:11.668
Goodness.

04:12.168 --> 04:13.419
Our star student.

04:13.503 --> 04:15.171
Did you get hurt anywhere?

04:15.255 --> 04:16.339
Are you all right?

04:16.422 --> 04:20.426
What the heck did those
Yongpa High punks do

04:21.094 --> 04:24.555
to get you, our dear Soo-ho,
involved in a brawl?

04:25.098 --> 04:26.683
Mr. Han Jun-woo?

04:26.766 --> 04:28.935
- Mr. Han Jun-woo?
- Yes.

04:29.018 --> 04:30.853
Right. I have a flower delivery for you.

04:32.689 --> 04:34.232
A flower delivery!

04:35.108 --> 04:36.442
- Flowers?
- Yes.

04:37.151 --> 04:39.279
- From who?
- Well, Ms. Lim Hee--

04:41.364 --> 04:42.490
I'm sorry.

04:43.533 --> 04:44.367
No worries.

04:45.118 --> 04:47.453
I know. I think I know who sent them.

04:50.039 --> 04:51.499
You guys…

04:52.208 --> 04:53.668
go wait in the guidance office.

04:53.751 --> 04:55.503
- You!
- Yes?

04:55.586 --> 04:56.421
And the others…

04:57.797 --> 04:58.923
To the guidance office.

04:59.007 --> 05:00.466
- Me?
- Us?

05:06.514 --> 05:07.974
Did you get the flowers?

05:08.057 --> 05:08.891
Ms. Lim Hee-kyung.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.561
Why did you send me flowers?

05:12.228 --> 05:15.523
I mean, can't a woman
send a man some flowers?

05:16.065 --> 05:17.317
We even shared a kiss.

05:18.026 --> 05:18.860
Ms. Lim Hee-kyung.

05:18.943 --> 05:20.320
They're bridalwreath spirea flowers.

05:20.403 --> 05:21.237
Bride…

05:22.030 --> 05:22.989
A bride's what?

05:23.573 --> 05:25.158
Bridalwreath spirea!

05:25.241 --> 05:27.160
I see.

05:27.243 --> 05:29.329
The flowers themselves are not the point.

05:29.412 --> 05:31.831
Do you know what they symbolize?

05:32.540 --> 05:34.000
They mean, "I'll try."

05:34.959 --> 05:37.920
I'm trying to make you my man, you know.

05:39.839 --> 05:42.717
So think of me
when you look at those flowers.

05:43.718 --> 05:45.428
I leave tomorrow for a business trip.

05:45.511 --> 05:46.721
Are you free this evening?

05:46.804 --> 05:47.722
Well…

05:47.805 --> 05:49.223
No, I'm busy.

05:49.307 --> 05:51.350
It's exam week, so it's been busy…

05:51.434 --> 05:53.227
I guess I'm the only disappointed one.

05:54.020 --> 05:56.647
You still don't want to
buy a new pair of shoes?

05:57.607 --> 05:58.733
Think hard about it.

06:07.617 --> 06:12.914
I'M SORRY

06:22.799 --> 06:26.135
Are you all some master calligraphers?
You're putting in too much effort.

06:26.219 --> 06:27.887
Why don't you make your own ink too?

06:27.970 --> 06:30.723
How will you fill out
ten pages at that speed?

06:30.807 --> 06:31.766
All right, watch.

06:32.934 --> 06:33.976
Look how I'm doing it.

06:34.060 --> 06:35.311
How's this?

06:35.394 --> 06:38.189
All those hours spent writing lines
have left me ambidextrous.

06:38.272 --> 06:39.440
Are you impressed?

06:39.524 --> 06:43.361
Babe, do you think they've ever
written a reflection letter?

06:43.444 --> 06:44.278
Look.

06:51.327 --> 06:52.328
Ta-da.

06:52.411 --> 06:53.830
Good for you.

06:53.913 --> 06:54.997
I'm sorry, guys.

06:55.873 --> 06:57.500
This is all because of me.

06:57.583 --> 06:59.043
Don't say that.

06:59.127 --> 07:00.002
Hey, Seo-jun.

07:01.170 --> 07:03.506
Apologize to Ju-kyung properly.

07:03.589 --> 07:06.551
We're in this mess because
they thought she was your girlfriend!

07:07.135 --> 07:07.969
Well…

07:08.678 --> 07:10.138
She looks healthy enough.

07:10.721 --> 07:12.098
What are your legs for?

07:13.933 --> 07:14.934
You should've run.

07:15.017 --> 07:16.936
Then is your mouth for annoying people?

07:17.019 --> 07:18.146
Enough.

07:18.688 --> 07:20.690
They won't look for you ever again.

07:21.274 --> 07:22.108
So don't worry.

07:23.776 --> 07:27.613
Don't tell me you sought them out
and fought with them.

07:27.697 --> 07:29.115
What do you mean by fight?

07:29.949 --> 07:31.742
They're not even on my level.

07:34.370 --> 07:36.330
More like I beat them up.

07:40.168 --> 07:41.461
- "Beat them up"?
- "Beat them up"?

07:45.965 --> 07:47.049
I'm scared.

07:47.133 --> 07:48.801
Let's just finish these quickly.

07:48.885 --> 07:50.094
Okay, Su-ah.

07:51.721 --> 07:52.972
Gosh, he's frightening.

08:02.398 --> 08:03.691
Hey, Soo-ho.

08:05.443 --> 08:07.695
No matter where things stand between us,

08:07.778 --> 08:09.572
my mom's situation is a separate issue,

08:10.615 --> 08:12.366
and I'm grateful for your help there.

08:13.618 --> 08:14.577
Even so,

08:15.369 --> 08:18.581
stay out of my business from now on.

08:26.964 --> 08:28.049
What's this?

08:28.132 --> 08:29.467
What are you playing at?

08:31.219 --> 08:32.053
I fell asleep.

08:36.891 --> 08:37.808
What the…

08:39.769 --> 08:41.103
What's wrong with him?

08:51.155 --> 08:52.365
Roar!

08:56.118 --> 08:56.953
Hey!

08:58.829 --> 09:00.581
- What?
- Do that thing.

09:01.415 --> 09:03.042
- Do what thing?
- You know what.

09:03.125 --> 09:04.585
The "roar."

09:05.169 --> 09:06.212
What?

09:06.295 --> 09:07.255
Whatever…

09:07.338 --> 09:10.550
Roar!

09:12.927 --> 09:15.221
Not in my wildest nightmares
do I want to see that.

09:15.304 --> 09:16.556
You're a wild beast.

09:18.975 --> 09:19.892
What was that?

09:21.185 --> 09:22.770
There's no way.

09:23.396 --> 09:25.356
I hope you're studying hard for the exam.

09:25.439 --> 09:29.068
Sir, can you please remove some chapters
from the material we have to cover?

09:29.151 --> 09:30.111
Just this much.

09:30.194 --> 09:33.239
- There's too much to review!
- Please, sir!

09:33.322 --> 09:36.909
Some may not be aware of
what their heart's desire is,

09:36.993 --> 09:39.453
and some may hesitate,
though they know what they want.

09:39.537 --> 09:43.165
As opportunity presents itself randomly
like a sudden storm in summer,

09:43.249 --> 09:45.126
only the prepared can seize it.

09:45.209 --> 09:48.921
If you want to take the opportunity
to make your dreams come true…

09:49.005 --> 09:51.632
Gosh, sir, thank you so much
for your encouragement.

09:51.716 --> 09:53.134
You're the best! Bye.

09:53.217 --> 09:55.595
- Thank you!
- Let's go!

09:57.471 --> 09:59.265
Hey, who wants to go get tteokbokki?

09:59.348 --> 10:00.933
Me!

10:02.226 --> 10:04.770
Study hard for your midterm exam…

10:05.813 --> 10:07.481
is what I'm trying to say.

10:09.025 --> 10:10.151
Class dismissed.

11:15.841 --> 11:16.884
Soo-ho.

11:17.885 --> 11:19.261
- Yes.
- Well…

11:20.012 --> 11:23.099
They released the newest volume
of Grotesque Scenario.

11:23.182 --> 11:25.184
Want to visit Prince Comics with me?

11:25.267 --> 11:26.394
No.

11:26.477 --> 11:27.436
Okay.

11:29.021 --> 11:30.898
What's keeping him so busy then?

11:34.985 --> 11:36.654
- Ju-kyung.
- Yes?

11:37.947 --> 11:39.782
But my bus is almost here…

11:40.783 --> 11:42.284
I didn't mean you should get in.

11:43.119 --> 11:44.578
You said you need better grades.

11:45.830 --> 11:48.624
Meet me at the study cafe tomorrow
so we can study together.

12:02.012 --> 12:03.889
You want to study together?

12:04.682 --> 12:05.599
Why?

12:11.814 --> 12:14.275
Obviously, I want to spend time with you.

12:22.616 --> 12:23.617
I'll see you tomorrow.

12:31.667 --> 12:34.420
It's only early evening at best,
and you say good night?

12:34.962 --> 12:38.299
You're thinking about going to bed
instead of studying for your exams?

12:38.382 --> 12:39.592
But I was studying.

12:40.301 --> 12:42.344
Make sure you rank
30 places higher this time.

12:42.428 --> 12:44.513
I'm throwing all of these away otherwise.

12:45.306 --> 12:46.390
I get it.

12:46.974 --> 12:48.893
You're the one
who's disrupting my studies.

13:22.468 --> 13:24.929
How does he look so handsome
even in his sleep?

13:26.722 --> 13:27.848
It gives me butterflies.

13:56.585 --> 13:58.170
I don't want to study.

13:58.254 --> 13:59.672
How come you fell asleep?

13:59.755 --> 14:01.340
You are not even trying to study.

14:01.423 --> 14:03.259
Name the three Blue Deer School poets.

14:03.342 --> 14:05.261
One, two, three.

14:06.178 --> 14:08.222
Seems you dozed off in class.
How will your grades improve?

14:08.305 --> 14:09.640
Goodness, it's intense.

14:10.266 --> 14:11.767
You're totally scaring her.

14:12.268 --> 14:14.186
You scolded her so much she's hiccuping.

14:22.027 --> 14:24.905
Right. Let's go to a baseball game
on the last day of exams.

14:24.989 --> 14:26.532
Hyeong-jin has a game that day.

14:26.615 --> 14:27.783
I can't. I have tutoring.

14:28.701 --> 14:31.662
Sure, I had fun the last time.

14:31.745 --> 14:33.038
Yay!

14:33.956 --> 14:35.833
But keep it a secret from Tae-hoon, okay?

14:37.710 --> 14:38.836
Keep what a secret?

14:39.628 --> 14:40.838
Nothing.

14:41.881 --> 14:44.300
Are you getting me
a surprise gift or something?

14:44.383 --> 14:46.051
No. Go back to studying.

14:53.726 --> 14:54.894
- We'll be off then.
- Okay.

14:54.977 --> 14:56.186
- Bye.
- Be safe!

14:56.270 --> 14:57.271
Let's go.

14:58.731 --> 15:01.233
- I'm leaving.
- Okay, bye.

15:02.318 --> 15:04.069
Why does he look so tired?

15:04.153 --> 15:06.155
- Let's go.
- Sure, let's.

15:06.822 --> 15:08.073
What's this guy doing here?

15:10.200 --> 15:11.243
Ju-kyung.

15:11.827 --> 15:14.121
In the karaoke room, I was…

15:18.250 --> 15:20.586
Jeez. I was going to apologize.

15:21.921 --> 15:23.923
Hey, I was going to say I'm sorry.

15:24.423 --> 15:25.925
I said it, okay? I did.

15:29.386 --> 15:30.763
What's up with him?

15:32.514 --> 15:33.682
Why?

15:33.766 --> 15:35.768
Why would he do that?

15:37.186 --> 15:38.520
Gosh, you startled me.

15:39.647 --> 15:42.232
Hey, you saw that, right?

15:42.316 --> 15:43.776
I did it. I apologized.

16:02.211 --> 16:03.629
APOLOGIZE

16:04.546 --> 16:06.048
What's with this punk?

16:06.131 --> 16:07.883
- Apologize!
- Apologize!

16:08.801 --> 16:14.807
- Apologize!
- Apologize!

16:14.890 --> 16:21.188
- Apologize!
- Apologize!

16:21.271 --> 16:24.024
- Apologize!
- Apologize!

16:32.658 --> 16:35.119
What is it? What's happening?

16:36.578 --> 16:39.164
APOLOGIZE!

16:39.748 --> 16:41.542
That crazy idiot!

16:44.253 --> 16:45.963
Damn it.

16:46.046 --> 16:48.007
Man, I almost had it…

16:52.678 --> 16:53.721
Dad, I'm home.

16:55.597 --> 16:57.016
Did you cause trouble again?

16:57.099 --> 16:58.058
Excuse me?

17:12.489 --> 17:14.199
I got no sleep chasing him around.

17:18.620 --> 17:20.247
But still, what a relief.

17:20.330 --> 17:23.083
I was worried he might hold a grudge
and come visit again.

17:23.167 --> 17:25.252
I won't lose sleep over him now.

17:26.712 --> 17:28.756
- Bottoms up, guys!
- Cheers!

17:28.839 --> 17:31.508
- Nice job, everyone!
- That must be nice.

17:31.592 --> 17:33.385
When will we ever get to be in college?

17:34.303 --> 17:36.305
Why do you think
people like alcohol so much?

17:36.388 --> 17:38.766
My sister gets wasted when she drinks.
She's like an animal.

17:39.433 --> 17:41.435
I guess drinking makes you feel better.

17:41.518 --> 17:42.978
Have you tried drinking before?

17:44.480 --> 17:47.316
I took a sip from a bottle
my dad had already opened.

17:48.525 --> 17:51.320
What? You've never even tasted it?

17:52.196 --> 17:55.449
I don't have the balls,
so I've never even tried to.

17:59.787 --> 18:01.914
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

18:05.667 --> 18:06.668
The finishing touch.

18:11.715 --> 18:13.550
How do I look? Do I look mature enough?

18:14.426 --> 18:17.262
You totally look like a college student.
Like a sorority queen.

18:17.346 --> 18:18.764
Stop it.

18:19.348 --> 18:20.390
I'm thirsty.

18:22.851 --> 18:26.438
Hey, our professor's lectures
have been really slow, right?

18:26.522 --> 18:27.356
Totally.

18:27.439 --> 18:30.901
What do you want to do
on Monday between lectures?

18:30.984 --> 18:31.819
I don't know.

18:31.902 --> 18:34.113
Maybe lunch with
the department representative?

18:34.196 --> 18:35.280
That sounds good.

18:38.033 --> 18:38.909
IDs, please.

18:41.161 --> 18:43.330
Gosh, I forgot to bring my ID.

18:43.413 --> 18:44.414
Do you have yours?

18:45.040 --> 18:46.291
I forgot mine too.

18:46.375 --> 18:47.835
Can we just pay for it?

18:47.918 --> 18:48.794
We're in college.

18:48.877 --> 18:50.963
- Which one?
- Second year at Hankook University.

18:51.046 --> 18:52.589
- What major?
- English Literature.

18:54.675 --> 18:56.093
- Your English teacher's name?
- Han Jun-woo!

18:56.176 --> 18:57.761
- Ju-kyung.
- You little…

18:57.845 --> 18:58.971
You punks.

18:59.054 --> 19:00.848
You're high schoolers, aren't you?

19:00.931 --> 19:02.975
Should I call your homeroom teacher?

19:03.600 --> 19:04.810
- We're sorry.
- We're sorry.

19:05.519 --> 19:07.312
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

19:12.776 --> 19:13.819
That feels nice.

19:14.444 --> 19:15.529
It tastes sweet.

19:17.322 --> 19:18.991
This looks so good.

19:19.074 --> 19:20.325
It smells amazing.

19:22.202 --> 19:23.412
How is it?

19:24.079 --> 19:25.122
So good!

19:25.914 --> 19:27.749
That was really dumb of me, wasn't it?

19:28.917 --> 19:31.378
How can you fall for that trick question?

19:32.629 --> 19:33.964
Hey, are you okay?

19:35.215 --> 19:37.050
Have you been applying some hand cream?

19:38.218 --> 19:39.261
It's okay.

19:39.344 --> 19:40.512
That looks painful.

19:41.263 --> 19:42.389
How did this happen?

19:42.472 --> 19:43.307
Well…

19:44.016 --> 19:45.517
it's because of my habit.

19:47.186 --> 19:50.731
I keep washing my hands.
I do it inadvertently when I'm stressed.

19:51.648 --> 19:53.650
I need to break out of it,
but it's not easy.

19:53.734 --> 19:54.651
Stressed?

19:55.319 --> 19:56.153
Why?

19:56.236 --> 19:57.404
What do you think?

19:58.655 --> 19:59.531
My grades.

20:00.782 --> 20:03.994
If I had your grades,
my parents would treat me like royalty.

20:04.077 --> 20:06.538
It's embarrassing as is,
so don't tell anyone, okay?

20:08.290 --> 20:10.334
You're the first friend I've told this to.

20:13.503 --> 20:14.463
Thank you.

20:15.088 --> 20:16.048
For confiding in me.

20:17.883 --> 20:19.051
What's there to thank?

20:23.347 --> 20:24.348
Actually.

20:25.224 --> 20:26.850
I was an outcast at my last school.

20:28.477 --> 20:29.770
- What?
- I was.

20:30.520 --> 20:33.732
But now, I'm so glad
I have a friend like you.

20:34.316 --> 20:35.943
Please keep this to yourself, okay?

20:36.443 --> 20:37.319
Cheers.

20:44.993 --> 20:46.119
Blue Deer School.

20:46.203 --> 20:50.374
Debuted by recommendation in 1939,
Cho Chi-hun, Pak Tu-jin, Pak Mok-wol…

20:54.503 --> 20:56.505
I could have seriously hurt my head.

20:57.339 --> 20:58.423
Thank you.

20:58.966 --> 21:00.550
I was protecting the tree, okay?

21:02.636 --> 21:04.096
It's as hard as a rock.

21:04.888 --> 21:06.306
What? A rock?

21:11.144 --> 21:12.271
What are you reading?

21:12.354 --> 21:15.148
Stop talking to me.
I can't mess up this exam.

21:16.191 --> 21:17.526
We have an exam today?

21:18.402 --> 21:19.611
On what?

21:19.695 --> 21:20.570
Literature.

21:21.238 --> 21:23.991
I get you don't care for studying,
but isn't this a bit much?

21:24.825 --> 21:26.451
You're not good at studying either.

21:26.994 --> 21:29.830
Hey, at least I put in some effort.

21:30.372 --> 21:33.625
What school did Cho Chi-hun, Pak Tu-jin,
and Pak Mok-wol belong to?

21:33.709 --> 21:35.961
I couldn't care less for any of that.

21:36.461 --> 21:38.839
You dummy. It's the Blue Deer School!

21:38.922 --> 21:41.174
This will be on the test, so take note.

21:41.258 --> 21:43.802
Life School Poets emerged in the 1930s…

21:43.885 --> 21:44.761
Whatever.

21:45.929 --> 21:48.432
What's your favorite number
from one to five?

21:49.349 --> 21:50.183
Three?

21:51.351 --> 21:53.478
I'll mark all my answers number five then.

22:13.749 --> 22:15.125
You didn't bring a marker?

22:15.208 --> 22:16.501
No. So I borrowed one!

22:16.585 --> 22:18.712
You should have told me, I brought three.

22:18.795 --> 22:20.547
I should have borrowed it from you.

22:20.630 --> 22:21.757
Do you feel prepared?

22:21.840 --> 22:24.217
No. I always choose three
if I don't know the answer.

22:24.301 --> 22:25.719
You should do that too, Limju.

22:25.802 --> 22:27.012
No, thanks.

22:27.095 --> 22:28.305
I'll solve my answers.

22:30.057 --> 22:32.976
Good luck with your exam. Do your best!

23:12.057 --> 23:13.767
No scented candle has been this good.

23:13.850 --> 23:15.811
Is it perfume or a scented candle?

23:15.894 --> 23:18.230
One handmade scented candle
goes for only 9,000 won.

23:18.313 --> 23:20.565
- I'll take two.
- Thank you, madam!

23:21.316 --> 23:22.734
These smell so good.

23:23.693 --> 23:25.445
- They do, right?
- Yes, they do.

23:25.529 --> 23:26.822
- Thank you.
- Sure.

23:26.905 --> 23:29.241
- Good luck with this.
- We'll get one next time.

23:29.324 --> 23:30.325
- Okay.
- Good luck!

23:30.408 --> 23:31.284
Thank you.

23:34.663 --> 23:36.248
I have a new customer.

23:37.374 --> 23:39.960
What do you think you're doing
for days on end in my shop?

23:40.043 --> 23:41.294
I'm making money.

23:41.378 --> 23:43.088
I made over 100,000 won today.

23:43.171 --> 23:44.881
Shut that mouth.

23:45.507 --> 23:47.300
What? You're doing good?

23:47.384 --> 23:49.553
- How much for the ingredients?
- 5,000 won a pop.

23:49.636 --> 23:51.304
- How many did you make?
- 50 to start.

23:51.388 --> 23:52.973
- How many were sold?
- About 30?

23:53.056 --> 23:54.975
You spent 250,000 won
and made 270,000 won.

23:55.058 --> 23:56.935
- Your class cost 100,000 won.
- 80,000 won.

23:57.769 --> 24:00.313
Including the cost of transportation,
this is a net loss.

24:00.397 --> 24:02.149
You're a lost cause.

24:02.232 --> 24:04.067
Stop wasting your time and money.

24:04.151 --> 24:06.778
Just stay still and breathe in and out.

24:06.862 --> 24:08.029
Got it?

24:09.865 --> 24:15.996
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!

24:16.079 --> 24:18.999
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!

24:19.082 --> 24:20.208
Strike!

24:23.378 --> 24:25.505
By the way, what did you tell Tae-hoon?

24:25.589 --> 24:27.799
I told him
it's my grandma's 80th birthday!

24:27.883 --> 24:29.801
Many happy returns, ma'am!

24:29.885 --> 24:32.470
Quite a birthday party.
Did you borrow the entire stadium?

24:32.554 --> 24:34.014
Is this a celebratory game?

24:35.682 --> 24:36.641
You thought I wouldn't know?

24:36.725 --> 24:40.228
- I'll go cheer for you in the semifinal!
- Spying on my social media activity?

24:40.312 --> 24:42.147
That's so creepy. I can't believe it.

24:42.230 --> 24:44.858
- Not as much as you lying to me!
- Would you have let me go if I told you?

24:44.941 --> 24:46.860
He's just a friend,
but you got so jealous.

24:46.943 --> 24:49.279
If I were actually interested,
I would've DMed him,

24:49.362 --> 24:51.948
not cheer for him
in the bleachers like this!

24:52.032 --> 24:53.700
Come on, guys. Don't fight.

24:53.783 --> 24:54.993
Did I say I doubted you?

24:55.076 --> 24:58.038
But your supposed friend
wouldn't think of you just as a friend!

24:58.121 --> 24:59.497
You're as pretty as an angel,

24:59.581 --> 25:02.000
so how could a guy
not fall in love with you?

25:03.376 --> 25:05.170
Well, you are right about that.

25:05.754 --> 25:07.839
But how can I leave now
when I got fried chicken?

25:07.923 --> 25:10.133
- Come on. That's not right.
- I'm sorry--

25:11.676 --> 25:13.470
You're so cute I can't stay mad at you.

25:16.223 --> 25:17.349
My heart.

25:18.767 --> 25:19.768
You're so adorable.

25:20.769 --> 25:24.898
- Babe, have some fried chicken.
- Will do. Thanks.

25:26.274 --> 25:27.359
By the way, Soo-ho.

25:27.442 --> 25:30.237
Why did you accompany Tae-hoon
when you two aren't even close?

25:31.279 --> 25:32.989
We're close. Starting today.

25:33.740 --> 25:34.574
Soo-ho.

25:35.951 --> 25:38.119
I love drumsticks,
but I'll give this to you.

25:39.287 --> 25:40.288
Congratulations.

25:52.133 --> 25:55.553
- The real deal has arrived, go Sunil!
- The real deal has arrived, go Sunil!

26:16.199 --> 26:17.367
What a jerk.

26:17.450 --> 26:20.036
Hey Soo-ho,
why are you being mean to Limju?

26:20.120 --> 26:21.329
Seriously.

26:23.081 --> 26:24.916
- I'll go throw this out.
- Okay.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.960
Isn't Hyeong-jin totally awesome?

26:27.043 --> 26:29.421
He might make it
to the Major Leagues at this rate!

26:31.172 --> 26:32.966
Hey, Hyeong-jin!

26:36.303 --> 26:37.262
What?

26:37.846 --> 26:38.847
Hyeong-jin!

26:45.103 --> 26:48.565
Do you know how much I looked for you
after the last game?

26:49.524 --> 26:51.026
You're a friend of Su-ah's?

26:52.277 --> 26:54.279
Excuse me?

26:55.405 --> 26:56.906
Up close,

26:56.990 --> 26:58.992
you look even more stunning.

26:59.075 --> 26:59.909
Goodness.

27:01.703 --> 27:04.539
I'm older than you
if you're Su-ah's friend, right?

27:08.001 --> 27:09.127
What's this, Hyeong-jin?

27:10.253 --> 27:11.087
Give me your number.

27:12.172 --> 27:13.006
My phone number?

27:13.089 --> 27:15.216
- Number!
- Number!

27:15.300 --> 27:17.594
I need to get going. Hurry and type it in.

27:17.677 --> 27:19.137
- Number!
- Number!

27:19.220 --> 27:21.639
- Well…
- Number!

27:21.723 --> 27:26.269
- Number!
- Number!

27:26.353 --> 27:29.731
- Number!
- Number!

27:29.814 --> 27:30.940
Here.

27:34.486 --> 27:36.446
Saved. I'll hit you up.

27:40.867 --> 27:41.951
I can't believe this!

27:42.035 --> 27:44.120
Hyeong-jin must have a crush on you!

27:45.163 --> 27:47.207
Do you just give out
your number to strangers?

27:47.290 --> 27:50.835
You think it's okay because she knows him?
What if he's a weirdo?

27:51.669 --> 27:52.504
What?

27:54.422 --> 27:55.298
I'm leaving.

27:58.760 --> 28:00.011
What's with him?

28:07.602 --> 28:08.978
I'll be frank with you.

28:09.646 --> 28:11.022
I've fallen for you.

28:11.773 --> 28:13.733
Even when buying a pair of shoes,

28:14.692 --> 28:16.027
I think hard about them

28:16.569 --> 28:18.655
and spend time closely looking at them.

28:19.406 --> 28:21.741
That way, I grow attached,
take better care of them,

28:21.825 --> 28:24.869
and cherish them
even when they're worn out.

28:26.162 --> 28:29.040
Why don't you start thinking hard about me

28:29.124 --> 28:31.835
and spend time closely looking at me?

28:32.502 --> 28:34.462
But when I don't intend to buy a pair,

28:35.463 --> 28:37.507
I avoid the shoe store completely.

28:39.092 --> 28:40.552
I'm sure you're wonderful,

28:41.428 --> 28:43.888
but I don't think I can be in
a relationship right now.

28:57.318 --> 29:00.530
You still don't want to
buy a new pair of shoes?

29:00.613 --> 29:02.699
I can't afford to be in love right now.

29:02.782 --> 29:03.867
What are you doing?

29:04.909 --> 29:06.661
Thinking about your girlfriend?

29:07.454 --> 29:08.413
No, sir.

29:08.496 --> 29:10.415
You totally are thinking about her!

29:10.498 --> 29:12.584
- No, it's not--
- He said he wasn't!

29:13.418 --> 29:15.086
- You're not, are you?
- Sure.

29:15.712 --> 29:16.880
If not, we're good.

29:18.381 --> 29:19.466
What's with her?

29:22.844 --> 29:25.263
Close your eyes

29:26.306 --> 29:29.392
- Feel the wind
- It's her voice.

29:29.476 --> 29:36.316
It's the caress of your mother's hand…

29:36.399 --> 29:38.067
That's the girl from the festival?

29:38.151 --> 29:39.527
She looks totally different.

29:39.611 --> 29:41.404
She's on Lim Ju-bal's level.

29:48.161 --> 29:49.788
That was brilliant. It was.

29:49.871 --> 29:53.792
The right amount of vibrato
and head voice for the high notes.

29:54.375 --> 29:55.293
What kind of crazy…

30:01.591 --> 30:03.051
She's so shy.

30:15.104 --> 30:16.314
Why did you follow me here?

30:18.483 --> 30:19.901
You like Ju-kyung, don't you?

30:20.401 --> 30:23.196
What, you thought I wouldn't know
when you made it so obvious?

30:23.279 --> 30:26.157
I thought it was weird
that you'd follow me to the stadium.

30:26.241 --> 30:27.617
But when eating fried chicken,

30:28.326 --> 30:30.286
I saw you give Ju-kyung
all the drumsticks.

30:30.370 --> 30:31.913
That's true love.

30:32.413 --> 30:35.375
And then I saw you being
super jealous of Ryu Hyeong-jin,

30:35.458 --> 30:36.876
which made it clear that you…

30:38.002 --> 30:40.213
I'm so smart. It's insane.

30:42.382 --> 30:43.341
But then again,

30:43.424 --> 30:44.801
why haven't you told her how you feel?

30:44.884 --> 30:47.637
Someone like Ryu Hyeong-jin
will get her if you hesitate.

30:50.306 --> 30:52.141
I mean, it hasn't happened yet.

31:00.650 --> 31:01.818
Have fun on your date.

31:02.402 --> 31:05.321
Hey, Su-ah! Choi Su…

31:06.573 --> 31:08.324
- How…
- I wanted to walk you home.

31:08.408 --> 31:10.159
- What?
- That's an excuse.

31:10.869 --> 31:13.246
I wanted to see you again,
so I snuck out of my dorm.

31:14.372 --> 31:15.331
You snuck out?

31:15.874 --> 31:16.708
Is that allowed?

31:16.791 --> 31:18.167
Of course not.

31:18.251 --> 31:20.628
I'll get kicked out if I get caught.

31:20.712 --> 31:21.546
Goodness!

31:22.338 --> 31:24.173
Then you should go back, please.

31:24.257 --> 31:25.091
Go…

31:26.843 --> 31:27.719
That was a joke.

31:27.802 --> 31:29.804
They won't kick out their star player!

31:31.347 --> 31:32.181
You're right.

31:34.100 --> 31:35.560
Three strikes.

31:36.269 --> 31:39.439
I think you totally got me.

31:40.773 --> 31:44.110
You were so harsh on her
when we were studying together.

31:44.193 --> 31:45.945
Being mean is not working for you.

31:46.029 --> 31:48.781
I'd date Ryu Hyeong-jin
who's upfront and charming

31:48.865 --> 31:50.033
if I were her.

31:50.116 --> 31:51.367
Come on, man.

31:51.451 --> 31:52.577
Then what should I do?

31:54.287 --> 31:55.997
What do we do with you?

31:56.080 --> 31:57.999
What do I do
with this relationship virgin?

31:59.542 --> 32:01.753
Do you want me to teach you a secret?

32:04.339 --> 32:05.506
Do you have a boyfriend?

32:06.841 --> 32:07.717
I don't.

32:08.885 --> 32:09.886
Really?

32:11.012 --> 32:13.222
I don't have a girlfriend either.

32:14.057 --> 32:15.558
If you think about it,

32:15.642 --> 32:18.603
the odds of my crush
reciprocating my feelings

32:19.479 --> 32:20.813
are almost as slim

32:20.897 --> 32:23.232
as having a perfect game in baseball.

32:25.818 --> 32:29.614
"The odds of my crush
reciprocating my feelings"?

32:37.246 --> 32:38.164
Hey!

32:45.004 --> 32:45.880
That's huge.

32:45.964 --> 32:47.590
Your will paid off, Yoo Tae-hoon.

32:47.674 --> 32:50.760
Lee Soo-ho finally caved
at your tenacious attempts.

32:50.843 --> 32:52.637
- I'm not washing my hand today.
- Sure.

32:53.721 --> 32:56.015
Your grades shouldn't determine
your happiness,

32:56.099 --> 32:58.017
but good grades would make you happy.

32:59.018 --> 33:01.479
Lee Soo-ho took first place
in the whole school.

33:01.562 --> 33:03.272
Congratulations. A round of applause!

33:04.941 --> 33:05.900
MIDTERM EXAM
LIM JU-KYUNG

33:05.984 --> 33:07.652
SUBJECT: LITERATURE
SCORE: 49

33:07.735 --> 33:09.445
- He's my friend!
- He got first place?

33:09.529 --> 33:10.530
Here, Seo-jun.

33:10.613 --> 33:11.739
I'm done for.

33:11.823 --> 33:12.657
All right.

33:12.740 --> 33:15.118
Let's give a round of applause
wishing him happiness.

33:17.870 --> 33:18.705
Good luck!

33:19.914 --> 33:20.957
I got 50 in Literature.

33:21.457 --> 33:23.543
I marked three for all my answers.
Awesome!

33:24.460 --> 33:26.671
Hey Ju-kyung, what's your score?

33:27.380 --> 33:28.506
Let me see. How is it?

33:28.589 --> 33:29.674
SCORE: 49

33:29.757 --> 33:30.633
You got 49?

33:31.676 --> 33:33.011
So that was all talk earlier.

33:33.511 --> 33:34.345
Keep it up.

33:38.808 --> 33:41.102
I should have marked
number three on everything.

33:41.185 --> 33:43.229
Mom's going to kill me.

33:47.817 --> 33:50.111
Su-jin, does that mean
you got second place again?

33:50.611 --> 33:52.280
That's a shame.

33:55.992 --> 33:58.036
TOTAL RANKING: 12, CLASS RANKING: 4

34:08.129 --> 34:10.548
I see you marked wrong
starting from number 30.

34:11.215 --> 34:13.843
Su-jin, what made you slip up
to make such a mistake?

34:15.011 --> 34:16.054
Excuse me.

34:21.768 --> 34:24.520
- What's wrong?
- I don't know. You're annoying.

34:29.150 --> 34:31.444
Hey, it's Ryu Hyeong-jin!

34:32.361 --> 34:35.031
- What?
- What? Isn't that Ryu Hyeong-jin?

34:36.783 --> 34:38.576
- Isn't that Ryu Hyeong-jin?
- Ryu Hyeong-jin?

34:38.659 --> 34:40.078
He's a treat to look at.

34:40.161 --> 34:41.496
He's so good-looking.

34:41.996 --> 34:43.372
What class is Lim Ju-kyung in?

34:43.456 --> 34:45.041
Lim Ju-kyung?

34:45.708 --> 34:47.460
You still ranked 20 places higher.

34:47.543 --> 34:49.629
It's not like it dropped,
so she won't get mad.

34:49.712 --> 34:50.671
- Right?
- Ju-kyung!

34:50.755 --> 34:52.048
- Yes.
- Ju-kyung.

34:52.965 --> 34:54.759
- Ju-kyung!
- Hyeong-jin?

34:59.347 --> 35:01.182
- It's Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Look at him!

35:01.265 --> 35:03.142
- What brought you here?
- To see you.

35:03.226 --> 35:05.061
He said, "to see you."

35:05.144 --> 35:06.145
Take it.

35:06.854 --> 35:07.897
"Take it," my foot.

35:07.980 --> 35:10.399
Hey, speak up.
I think he wants to fight you--

35:10.483 --> 35:14.320
This is my lucky ball,
so I can't pitch without it.

35:15.238 --> 35:16.781
Then you shouldn't give me--

35:17.907 --> 35:19.867
I'm asking you to come to the final.

35:21.035 --> 35:22.370
If I win the game,

35:22.453 --> 35:24.872
I have something to say to you officially.

35:25.915 --> 35:28.000
Can't you just say it here?

35:28.084 --> 35:29.085
No way.

35:29.168 --> 35:31.170
Who would ever ask someone out so lazily?

35:32.380 --> 35:34.173
Gosh, he just said he'd ask her out!

35:36.843 --> 35:38.928
Lim Ju-kyung, you're quite popular.

35:40.263 --> 35:43.266
Until recently, there were rumors
that you were dating me.

35:43.349 --> 35:45.017
You can't move on so quickly.

35:45.101 --> 35:46.144
What?

35:46.227 --> 35:47.979
You're being insensitive to your ex.

35:50.231 --> 35:52.108
What are you brats doing?

35:52.191 --> 35:53.151
Who are you?

35:53.818 --> 35:55.278
Come see me play…

35:55.361 --> 35:56.654
- Beautiful.
- Hey, you!

35:59.490 --> 36:00.992
- Hyeong-jin!
- Hyeong-jin!

36:05.037 --> 36:06.330
Where are you going?

36:16.716 --> 36:19.552
Hey Soo-ho, do you remember me?

36:20.553 --> 36:24.348
We were in the same class last year.
We did group projects together as well.

36:25.892 --> 36:29.437
Actually, I've had a crush on you
since last year.

36:31.230 --> 36:32.899
If you're not seeing anyone, would you--

36:32.982 --> 36:33.816
No.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.693
I like someone else.

36:43.701 --> 36:45.453
He likes someone else?

36:55.004 --> 36:56.839
He likes someone?

37:04.347 --> 37:06.432
Make sure you come, beautiful!

37:12.939 --> 37:15.274
Soon, there'll be spring rain.

37:15.358 --> 37:18.527
So I got myself
a pretty pair of rain boots.

37:18.611 --> 37:20.529
- How do they look? Pretty?
- Yes.

37:20.613 --> 37:23.282
- Do they look good on me?
- Yes.

37:25.868 --> 37:28.162
Your mom's really mad.

37:30.039 --> 37:31.666
She threw out all your makeup.

37:32.250 --> 37:33.251
What?

37:34.669 --> 37:36.212
Focus, everyone!

37:36.295 --> 37:38.547
One, two, three!

37:42.885 --> 37:43.803
How long will you…

37:43.886 --> 37:45.304
Here are the apples.

38:06.200 --> 38:08.411
- Mom!
- When did you get home?

38:08.494 --> 38:09.787
Where's all my makeup?

38:11.622 --> 38:13.624
I threw them out. Why would you ask?

38:13.708 --> 38:14.834
What?

38:14.917 --> 38:17.336
I called your teacher
and heard everything.

38:17.420 --> 38:18.963
You didn't score 30 places higher.

38:19.046 --> 38:21.257
But my grades went up, though!

38:21.340 --> 38:23.634
They didn't go down.
Can you cut me a little slack?

38:23.718 --> 38:26.053
Yes, she scored 20 places
higher than the last time.

38:26.137 --> 38:28.764
You won't be able to go to a college
in a metropolitan area

38:28.848 --> 38:31.225
even if you score 50 places higher.

38:31.309 --> 38:32.977
Did I say to rank 30th in the school?

38:33.060 --> 38:34.478
If you had truly tried,

38:34.562 --> 38:37.106
it wouldn't have been so hard
to score 30 places higher.

38:37.189 --> 38:38.024
Right.

38:38.107 --> 38:40.026
Your grades were pretty low to begin with.

38:40.109 --> 38:42.194
But still, I tried really hard.

38:43.070 --> 38:43.988
Where is my makeup?

38:44.071 --> 38:46.115
You didn't actually throw it all out,
did you?

38:46.198 --> 38:48.534
- Did you hide it?
- I really threw it out!

38:48.617 --> 38:52.038
Don't you ever go around
with makeup on your face again.

38:52.121 --> 38:54.582
I'll throw you away, not just the makeup.

38:54.665 --> 38:55.499
What?

38:57.626 --> 38:58.878
You really threw it away?

38:59.545 --> 39:01.964
Mom! You know how much it meant to me.

39:02.048 --> 39:03.758
Yet you threw it away without a word?

39:03.841 --> 39:06.344
- That was mine, not yours!
- You didn't do as promised!

39:06.427 --> 39:08.596
I can't do it even if I try hard!

39:08.679 --> 39:10.097
Is it my fault that I'm stupid?

39:10.181 --> 39:11.849
What do you mean, you can't do it?

39:11.932 --> 39:13.976
You didn't try harder than others,
that's why!

39:14.060 --> 39:16.020
I really tried my best this time!

39:16.520 --> 39:18.147
How come you don't believe me?

39:18.898 --> 39:20.358
You never believe what I say.

39:22.610 --> 39:24.737
This is the reason why
I don't tell you things.

39:24.820 --> 39:28.282
You're talking back and crying
for throwing away some makeup?

39:28.991 --> 39:29.825
Okay.

39:30.451 --> 39:31.619
What did you not tell me?

39:32.244 --> 39:33.454
What did you not tell me?

39:35.581 --> 39:38.167
Do you know why
I care so much about makeup?

39:39.168 --> 39:40.711
Do you even know how I feel?

39:41.712 --> 39:42.671
You…

39:42.755 --> 39:44.340
don't know a thing about me.

39:46.300 --> 39:48.010
How things were for me…

39:49.512 --> 39:50.846
at my last school.

40:00.314 --> 40:02.316
Where do you think
you're going at this hour?

40:02.858 --> 40:06.195
Go! Leave and never come back, you brat!

40:06.278 --> 40:07.738
Honey, calm down.

40:14.954 --> 40:18.207
Soo-ho, you need to make
the other person's heart flutter.

40:18.290 --> 40:21.168
Like butterflies in the stomach. Get it?

40:21.252 --> 40:22.962
First, go to her place.

40:23.045 --> 40:24.255
Then call her. She answers?

40:24.338 --> 40:26.132
Tell her you miss her. Straight up!

40:26.215 --> 40:27.258
With a deep breath,

40:28.509 --> 40:29.635
filled with longing…

40:30.761 --> 40:33.639
Then she'll say,
"Where are you right now?"

40:33.722 --> 40:35.015
That's your cue.

40:35.099 --> 40:35.933
"Open your window."

40:37.768 --> 40:40.146
Gaze at her longingly.

40:40.229 --> 40:41.814
That's the key. Write it down.

40:41.897 --> 40:44.525
When she comes out running,
hug her and grab the wall.

40:44.608 --> 40:46.944
- When you grab the wall…
- Must I?

40:47.987 --> 40:49.029
Against the wall?

40:49.697 --> 40:50.823
Do you not watch dramas?

40:50.906 --> 40:52.700
You look like you could star in one.

40:52.783 --> 40:54.034
What do I do with you?

40:56.579 --> 40:57.872
Have you ever kissed…

40:58.414 --> 40:59.415
Jeez.

40:59.498 --> 41:01.000
Hey, what's after the wall?

41:01.083 --> 41:03.377
- Forget about the wall.
- Hey.

41:33.365 --> 41:34.200
Ju-kyung.

41:48.214 --> 41:49.256
You didn't have dinner?

41:52.134 --> 41:53.219
What's that?

41:56.805 --> 41:59.099
My mom really threw all my makeup away.

41:59.183 --> 42:01.018
Just because my grades
didn't go up 30 places.

42:01.685 --> 42:03.354
Really gave me no slack.

42:06.815 --> 42:07.691
So you cried?

42:08.651 --> 42:09.652
No.

42:12.696 --> 42:14.782
Right. You saw me.

42:16.951 --> 42:17.785
Well…

42:19.286 --> 42:20.579
I was just frustrated.

42:30.381 --> 42:33.467
She doesn't even know
why I care so much about makeup.

42:33.551 --> 42:35.553
She could've at least made me smart.

42:37.304 --> 42:38.180
Good job.

42:43.477 --> 42:44.478
You did well.

42:45.980 --> 42:47.523
I know you tried hard.

42:47.606 --> 42:48.899
You scored 20 places higher.

42:50.067 --> 42:51.068
I'm proud of you.

42:54.697 --> 42:55.656
Are you crying again?

42:58.576 --> 42:59.785
I'm not…

42:59.868 --> 43:01.161
Are you making fun of me?

43:01.870 --> 43:04.498
It doesn't feel sincere at all
coming from the top student.

43:06.834 --> 43:08.085
Is there anything I can do?

43:09.086 --> 43:09.920
Should I get you

43:10.546 --> 43:11.880
a whole new set of makeup?

43:12.631 --> 43:14.174
Why are you being so sweet today?

43:16.135 --> 43:18.804
You're always so cool and brisk,

43:18.887 --> 43:20.347
so I don't know what's gotten into you.

43:20.931 --> 43:22.766
Don't girls like guys cool and brisk?

43:23.642 --> 43:24.476
What?

43:25.728 --> 43:26.770
What about you?

43:35.821 --> 43:38.699
Where is she scampering about
at this late hour?

43:39.450 --> 43:41.285
I called Prince Comics.

43:42.119 --> 43:43.078
She's there.

43:44.580 --> 43:45.539
She is?

43:47.416 --> 43:48.792
That place, really.

43:50.169 --> 43:51.003
By the way,

43:51.712 --> 43:53.756
what could she possibly have not told me?

43:54.673 --> 43:56.300
Could she have gotten into trouble?

43:56.383 --> 43:58.802
Ju-kyung couldn't have done anything bad.

44:01.013 --> 44:03.432
Kids might have picked on her
for her looks at school,

44:03.515 --> 44:04.767
but that's probably not it.

44:04.850 --> 44:06.435
What do you mean by her looks?

44:06.518 --> 44:07.645
She looks very nice.

44:07.728 --> 44:08.979
Of course, she does.

44:09.063 --> 44:09.980
She takes after you.

44:13.984 --> 44:15.361
That makes me feel oddly bad.

44:30.959 --> 44:31.794
What?

44:32.461 --> 44:33.337
I…

44:34.338 --> 44:36.799
I think I stepped on something weird.

44:37.675 --> 44:38.842
Is it a worm?

44:38.926 --> 44:40.928
It's nothing. Just a twig.

44:41.011 --> 44:42.763
No.

44:43.972 --> 44:45.349
It's definitely a worm.

44:45.933 --> 44:47.434
No. It's a twig.

44:51.230 --> 44:52.815
It is a worm.

44:52.898 --> 44:54.191
I hate worms.

44:54.274 --> 44:55.150
How do I…

44:58.779 --> 45:01.115
Hold still. I'll get it off for you.

45:13.585 --> 45:15.379
You could fall down. Sit.

45:17.131 --> 45:18.882
Can I, really?

45:30.519 --> 45:31.770
I meant over there.

45:33.230 --> 45:34.064
What?

45:36.692 --> 45:37.609
Nothing.

45:38.569 --> 45:39.903
Here, all done.

45:40.821 --> 45:42.906
Okay. Thanks.

45:48.245 --> 45:49.872
Get home safe.

45:51.832 --> 45:52.833
Wait.

46:19.193 --> 46:20.360
So you study hard.

46:23.280 --> 46:24.156
Good night.

46:52.309 --> 46:53.852
- You're home so late!
- You're home?

46:53.936 --> 46:55.562
Don't we need to have a talk first?

46:55.646 --> 46:57.189
Lim Ju-kyung!

47:20.087 --> 47:21.213
What do I do?

47:24.841 --> 47:26.718
It feels like my heart is going to burst.

47:47.739 --> 47:49.992
Do you want to go on a date with me?

47:50.909 --> 47:51.743
Want to go on a date?

47:51.827 --> 47:52.786
Go out for a date?

47:52.869 --> 47:53.787
Do you want to

47:53.870 --> 47:54.871
catch a movie with me?

47:54.955 --> 47:55.789
Let's go see a movie.

47:55.872 --> 47:56.707
Want to grab dinner?

47:56.790 --> 47:57.791
Let's have a meal together.

48:00.210 --> 48:03.422
Didn't you know your dad
was just waiting to scold you?

48:04.840 --> 48:08.051
Not beating Soo-ho's one thing,
but 12th place?

48:08.135 --> 48:10.345
You've never fallen below 10th place.

48:13.348 --> 48:15.392
Are you dating someone?

48:17.227 --> 48:18.103
It's just…

48:18.186 --> 48:19.688
we can't let you get distracted--

48:19.771 --> 48:21.732
Mom, not you too!

48:23.275 --> 48:24.735
Su-jin!

48:27.279 --> 48:29.781
Still, how could he slap her face?

48:51.178 --> 48:53.347
BEST RESTAURANTS FOR A DATE

48:54.222 --> 48:56.516
TOP 8 RESTAURANTS THAT WOMEN LIKE
ON SAEBOM STREET

48:56.600 --> 48:58.435
PLANNING A DATE ALWAYS
GIVES YOU BUTTERFLIES…

49:26.505 --> 49:28.715
- Why are you following me?
- What's going on?

49:31.009 --> 49:31.927
What do you mean?

49:33.261 --> 49:34.513
Did you get slapped?

49:36.056 --> 49:37.432
Your dad's doing this again?

49:39.518 --> 49:40.644
You knew all along?

49:42.020 --> 49:42.938
How could I not?

49:47.067 --> 49:48.652
You're really annoying.

49:48.735 --> 49:50.362
I can't keep doing this,

49:51.279 --> 49:53.740
one-sidedly trying to do better than you.

49:53.824 --> 49:55.617
It's all so frustrating!

49:56.368 --> 49:58.954
I'm over constantly being compared to you.

50:01.081 --> 50:02.582
I can't keep this up anymore.

50:03.667 --> 50:05.168
Why are you at my school?

50:05.752 --> 50:07.337
Transfer somewhere else!

51:03.810 --> 51:04.936
I like someone else.

51:42.766 --> 51:43.600
Hey.

51:44.434 --> 51:46.770
Forget what I said.

51:46.853 --> 51:47.771
I mean it, okay?

51:50.232 --> 51:52.234
- Does he do that often?
- No.

51:52.317 --> 51:54.236
If he did, I'd have reported him long ago.

51:54.319 --> 51:57.239
Don't keep it all to yourself.
Tell me if you need help.

52:00.283 --> 52:02.869
I guess you think of me as a friend?

52:02.953 --> 52:04.037
Of course, you're a friend.

52:05.622 --> 52:08.917
Anyway, are my eyes super red?
Does it look like I cried?

52:13.171 --> 52:15.423
- A little.
- Then let me borrow this.

52:36.862 --> 52:38.864
Okay, let's begin today's class.

52:38.947 --> 52:40.156
- Okay.
- Okay.

52:40.866 --> 52:44.786
First, we'll review the nationwide exam
conducted in September.

52:45.871 --> 52:48.832
We're only going to go over
the important questions,

52:48.915 --> 52:51.960
so please solve the problems
on the sheet I gave you.

52:52.043 --> 52:53.712
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes, ma'am.

52:59.843 --> 53:02.721
We learned about derivatives today,
so make sure to review them.

53:02.804 --> 53:04.848
Next time, we'll move on
to their application.

53:04.931 --> 53:05.932
See you next time.

53:06.016 --> 53:08.518
- Okay, thank you.
- Thank you.

53:13.857 --> 53:14.941
Your eyes look fine now.

53:17.152 --> 53:19.362
I thought we were friends.
You're so heartless.

53:23.533 --> 53:24.701
She already left.

53:25.577 --> 53:28.038
Hey, let me have this.

53:32.000 --> 53:32.834
Bye.

53:47.182 --> 53:48.058
Right.

53:48.975 --> 53:50.644
It wasn't as if I had deep feelings.

53:51.728 --> 53:53.897
Who wouldn't get butterflies
seeing that face?

53:56.816 --> 53:59.361
It was more of a fan's adoration.

53:59.444 --> 54:01.071
You get upset when you hear a rumor

54:01.154 --> 54:03.406
that your favorite celebrity
is in a relationship.

54:04.157 --> 54:06.785
You can always stop being a fan
when you get tired of them.

54:32.352 --> 54:35.146
He should have told me
if he liked someone.

54:35.230 --> 54:36.606
I got confused for no reason.

54:36.690 --> 54:39.025
Why give me the hair clip
or have me sit on his shoulders?

54:39.109 --> 54:41.277
What a scumbag.

54:41.361 --> 54:42.237
Lee Soo-ho,

54:42.737 --> 54:45.115
I will crush you!

54:45.991 --> 54:47.575
Hey, Lim Ju-bal.

54:47.659 --> 54:49.411
Lee Soo-ho, seriously!

54:51.955 --> 54:53.707
Lee Soo-ho, I'll be watching you!

55:03.258 --> 55:05.552
Ms. Lim, did you have
a pleasant business trip?

55:05.635 --> 55:07.637
I did, thank you.

55:11.558 --> 55:12.684
What's this?

55:14.602 --> 55:16.271
THANK YOU

55:20.734 --> 55:21.818
Thank you.

55:24.029 --> 55:25.905
Seriously, this guy.

55:45.216 --> 55:47.594
LIM HEE-KYUNG

55:52.015 --> 55:52.891
Hello?

55:52.974 --> 55:54.017
What are you doing?

55:55.143 --> 55:56.770
I was sleeping.

55:57.353 --> 55:58.521
Did I wake you?

56:01.066 --> 56:03.026
How was your business trip?

56:03.109 --> 56:04.486
You were waiting for me?

56:05.862 --> 56:07.072
I guess not.

56:09.741 --> 56:10.784
I miss your face.

56:11.868 --> 56:12.994
Are you still outside?

56:13.078 --> 56:14.579
Can you open your window?

56:28.426 --> 56:30.470
You're not going to let me see your face?

56:31.471 --> 56:33.515
Even a longing look doesn't work on you.

56:48.780 --> 56:49.697
How did you…

56:52.117 --> 56:53.618
Why did you send the flowers back?

56:56.329 --> 56:57.664
Not to think about me?

56:59.833 --> 57:01.501
Are you not going to see me anymore?

57:04.254 --> 57:05.880
Should we not see each other?

57:10.802 --> 57:11.845
I don't want that!

57:29.154 --> 57:32.615
RESERVED FOR LIM JU-KYUNG.
SIT HERE AND YOU'LL GROW BUTT HAIR.

57:35.618 --> 57:37.787
Want to come to Prince Comics?

57:39.247 --> 57:40.540
Is something wrong?

57:42.625 --> 57:44.252
Why are there so many?

57:51.050 --> 57:52.260
Are you a ghost?

57:52.343 --> 57:54.262
I'm not in the mood for jokes.

57:54.345 --> 57:55.305
Are you ill?

57:56.014 --> 57:57.307
You should have told me.

57:57.390 --> 57:58.641
I'm not sick.

57:59.434 --> 58:02.479
Of course, I should help you choose
Go-un's birthday present.

58:03.062 --> 58:05.482
- Did you get dumped by Ryu Hyeong-jin?
- No.

58:05.565 --> 58:06.649
That's what it is!

58:06.733 --> 58:07.942
I said it's not.

58:08.026 --> 58:11.070
He even sent me a ticket
asking me to come watch him.

58:11.946 --> 58:12.780
Really?

58:12.864 --> 58:15.033
You have the face
of someone who got dumped.

58:16.326 --> 58:17.327
Let's go.

58:19.579 --> 58:21.915
I just didn't get enough sleep.

58:22.999 --> 58:24.292
He's good.

58:33.593 --> 58:34.636
Hello?

58:36.179 --> 58:37.013
Are you home?

58:37.805 --> 58:40.058
No, I'm at the mall.

58:40.141 --> 58:40.975
What's up?

58:42.810 --> 58:44.187
Did you go by yourself?

58:44.270 --> 58:45.230
Ju-kyung.

58:46.731 --> 58:47.774
Hurry up.

58:48.358 --> 58:49.651
Are you with Seo-jun?

58:51.653 --> 58:52.487
Well…

58:52.570 --> 58:55.365
It's busy here. I'll call you later.

59:07.502 --> 59:10.171
The scent of makeup lifts my mood.

59:11.005 --> 59:12.215
You're getting her makeup?

59:12.298 --> 59:14.717
Yes, she has a recital coming up
at her academy.

59:14.801 --> 59:16.970
She was practicing stage makeup
pretty intently.

59:17.053 --> 59:19.347
- I hear she's attending a musical academy.
- She is.

59:19.430 --> 59:21.641
How are you both so good at singing?

59:23.017 --> 59:24.561
You've never heard me sing before.

59:25.061 --> 59:26.354
I heard you were a trainee.

59:26.437 --> 59:27.981
They say you are amazing.

59:28.898 --> 59:30.400
Why have you stopped training?

59:33.236 --> 59:36.239
What's so great about being a celebrity?
Just help me pick a gift.

59:38.741 --> 59:39.993
For stage makeup,

59:40.076 --> 59:41.911
a super-pigmented eye shadow

59:41.995 --> 59:44.789
or a smudge-free lip stain would be nice.

59:45.999 --> 59:48.876
These are the new lip tints.
I wonder if they're long-lasting.

59:55.133 --> 59:57.343
I put it over my lipstick,
so it's hard to say.

59:57.427 --> 59:58.428
Can you try it?

59:58.511 --> 59:59.345
No.

59:59.846 --> 01:00:02.557
- You used it on your lips.
- It's just a tester. Come on.

01:00:02.640 --> 01:00:04.517
- No.
- Come on.

01:00:12.066 --> 01:00:13.443
It has decent pigmentation.

01:00:15.486 --> 01:00:16.446
Want to get this one?

01:00:18.781 --> 01:00:20.533
- Hey, Seo-jun.
- Yes?

01:00:20.617 --> 01:00:21.743
This one?

01:00:22.702 --> 01:00:24.078
Right.

01:00:24.162 --> 01:00:25.622
I'll get her this.

01:00:29.751 --> 01:00:31.210
The checkout is that way, right?

01:00:39.385 --> 01:00:40.219
Her?

01:00:40.303 --> 01:00:41.137
It's cold.

01:00:41.220 --> 01:00:42.138
Me?

01:00:43.222 --> 01:00:44.140
Surely not.

01:00:45.850 --> 01:00:47.602
The door is opening.

01:00:50.063 --> 01:00:51.397
YANGKWANG UNIVERSITY
SSIREUM TEAM

01:00:59.238 --> 01:01:00.823
Hey, back up.

01:01:00.907 --> 01:01:02.492
- You'll get makeup on you.
- Okay.

01:01:04.118 --> 01:01:05.161
We are at maximum capacity.

01:01:05.244 --> 01:01:07.246
- I told you to lose some weight.
- I'm sorry.

01:01:07.330 --> 01:01:09.165
Hey, hold your breath. Two, Three.

01:01:12.418 --> 01:01:14.253
We are at maximum capacity.

01:01:14.921 --> 01:01:16.506
I told you to go easy at lunch.

01:01:16.589 --> 01:01:19.342
We can take the next one. Let's get off.

01:01:20.176 --> 01:01:22.470
- But lunch was so good.
- This is embarrassing.

01:01:37.735 --> 01:01:39.529
- How did you…
- Let's go.

01:01:42.073 --> 01:01:44.659
Where are you going?
This isn't even the first floor.

01:01:48.746 --> 01:01:49.622
Excuse me…

01:01:55.294 --> 01:01:56.212
I said, let's go.

01:01:59.757 --> 01:02:00.800
What a nuisance.

01:02:20.987 --> 01:02:21.988
What is it?

01:02:23.698 --> 01:02:26.409
Look, I think the elevator
stopped working!

01:02:33.166 --> 01:02:35.251
UNDER MAINTENANCE

01:02:38.921 --> 01:02:39.964
Why don't you let go?

01:02:40.923 --> 01:02:41.883
If you let go first.

01:02:43.968 --> 01:02:45.928
- Why are you here?
- To go shopping.

01:02:46.012 --> 01:02:47.889
You? Shopping?

01:02:47.972 --> 01:02:49.098
I can't shop?

01:02:49.182 --> 01:02:51.142
Go shopping if you're here for that.

01:02:51.809 --> 01:02:52.894
Why hold onto her?

01:02:52.977 --> 01:02:54.020
She's going to join me.

01:02:55.438 --> 01:02:56.439
Let go.

01:02:57.607 --> 01:02:58.900
Let go of me.

01:02:58.983 --> 01:03:00.943
This damned shopping!

01:03:04.655 --> 01:03:06.032
What's wrong? Are you okay?

01:03:06.699 --> 01:03:09.202
Is it because you're scared?
They'll get us out soon.

01:03:10.620 --> 01:03:12.371
- Wait for a bit.
- No.

01:03:13.080 --> 01:03:13.956
I can't.

01:03:15.500 --> 01:03:17.835
I can't hold it anymore!

01:03:17.919 --> 01:03:20.046
Why did you have to get me a large coffee?

01:03:20.129 --> 01:03:24.050
And you probably broke the elevator
playing with the buttons!

01:03:25.343 --> 01:03:28.095
- What do I do?
- Excuse me!

01:03:28.179 --> 01:03:29.806
When can you open the door?

01:03:34.268 --> 01:03:35.311
Are you insane?

01:03:38.523 --> 01:03:41.150
- Come on, hurry, please.
- Okay.

01:03:43.611 --> 01:03:45.571
- Are you okay?
- We'll get it opened soon.

01:03:45.655 --> 01:03:47.657
Please don't move.

01:04:03.506 --> 01:04:05.508
How can I face Soo-ho again after this?

01:04:05.591 --> 01:04:07.969
I should just die.

01:04:14.100 --> 01:04:16.102
They didn't say it was going to snow.

01:04:38.249 --> 01:04:40.209
Hello, beautiful.

01:04:40.793 --> 01:04:42.587
- How…
- My goodness.

01:04:43.504 --> 01:04:45.006
It's destiny!

01:04:48.426 --> 01:04:52.889
Some may not be aware of
what their heart's desire is,

01:04:54.223 --> 01:04:56.684
and some may hesitate,
though they know what they want.

01:04:58.394 --> 01:05:02.648
As opportunity presents itself randomly
like a sudden storm in summer,

01:05:03.691 --> 01:05:05.526
only the prepared can seize it.

01:05:25.463 --> 01:05:26.964
- I'm sorry.
- I'm sorry.

01:05:28.966 --> 01:05:31.719
Hey there, friend.
It's good to see you here.

01:05:32.845 --> 01:05:33.763
Why are you here?

01:05:34.680 --> 01:05:37.099
Obviously to watch baseball.
Why else would I be here?

01:05:37.183 --> 01:05:40.061
- I thought you didn't like baseball.
- I grew to like it.

01:05:40.144 --> 01:05:41.938
- Since when?
- Since lately.

01:05:42.021 --> 01:05:44.357
Really? High school baseball at that?

01:05:44.440 --> 01:05:46.108
It's not like
only professional games count.

01:05:46.192 --> 01:05:48.027
Don't look down on high school baseball.

01:05:54.033 --> 01:05:55.242
Looks like it will be fun.

01:05:56.118 --> 01:05:57.119
Enjoy the game.

01:05:57.870 --> 01:05:59.413
Ryu Hyeong-jin enters the stadium.

01:05:59.497 --> 01:06:02.124
Goodness, he has an intense look.

01:06:02.208 --> 01:06:05.920
His presence alone sets
a different mood over the stadium.

01:06:06.003 --> 01:06:09.048
Fortunately, he seems to be
in good shape today.

01:06:09.131 --> 01:06:11.926
The highlight of the game today
is Sunil's Monster Pitcher…

01:06:12.009 --> 01:06:13.302
Have you seen Ju-kyung?

01:06:13.386 --> 01:06:14.929
She went out earlier.

01:06:15.846 --> 01:06:18.432
She should be studying
at home on a weekend.

01:06:18.516 --> 01:06:20.643
It doesn't matter
how many times I scold her.

01:06:30.444 --> 01:06:33.114
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:06:33.781 --> 01:06:35.324
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:06:36.575 --> 01:06:37.994
Strike!

01:06:38.077 --> 01:06:41.622
I hear recruiters from the Major Leagues
are here to see Ryu Hyeong-jin.

01:06:41.706 --> 01:06:42.665
That's amazing.

01:06:42.748 --> 01:06:45.835
Will he be going to the US
if he does well in today's game?

01:06:45.918 --> 01:06:47.086
Without a doubt.

01:06:47.670 --> 01:06:49.839
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:06:49.922 --> 01:06:55.052
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:06:55.136 --> 01:06:57.179
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:07:00.099 --> 01:07:02.643
To maintain the best fastball,

01:07:02.727 --> 01:07:05.146
it's said that you must keep
the balance of your body…

01:07:05.229 --> 01:07:07.857
- Where have you been?
- I went to buy a selfie stick.

01:07:07.940 --> 01:07:11.694
Already thinking like a professional.
Isn't he impressive?

01:07:11.777 --> 01:07:14.280
People say it is impossible
to beat a diligent genius…

01:07:14.363 --> 01:07:16.615
Gosh, he's already a big shot.

01:07:17.366 --> 01:07:19.118
Every team would want him.

01:07:21.162 --> 01:07:23.539
What kind of baseball player
is that handsome?

01:07:26.625 --> 01:07:28.878
That guy asked me out.

01:07:30.004 --> 01:07:31.714
Hey, why would he do that?

01:07:31.797 --> 01:07:33.966
I'm serious. I even rejected him.

01:07:34.884 --> 01:07:36.635
Unbelievable.

01:07:43.642 --> 01:07:47.021
I'll send you the baseball
through a courier.

01:07:48.105 --> 01:07:49.065
I'm sorry.

01:07:49.148 --> 01:07:50.566
What do you mean?

01:07:51.650 --> 01:07:53.819
I like someone else.

01:07:59.950 --> 01:08:01.535
Does that person like you back?

01:08:08.292 --> 01:08:11.629
You said the odds of that happening
are as slim as that of a perfect game.

01:08:21.764 --> 01:08:24.934
Ryu Hyeong-jin's perfect finish!

01:08:25.017 --> 01:08:29.063
He never fails to disappoint.

01:08:29.146 --> 01:08:32.024
With Ryu Hyeong-jin's
wonderful performance,

01:08:32.775 --> 01:08:35.194
Sunil High wins
the High School Baseball Final!

01:08:38.280 --> 01:08:40.866
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:08:40.950 --> 01:08:44.286
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:08:44.370 --> 01:08:50.459
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!
- Monster pitcher, Ryu Hyeong-jin!

01:08:52.336 --> 01:08:53.379
Did you have fun?

01:08:55.965 --> 01:08:56.882
It was fun.

01:08:56.966 --> 01:08:59.176
Really? It wasn't fun for me.

01:08:59.885 --> 01:09:01.846
I came in case Ju-kyung would come.

01:09:02.513 --> 01:09:03.639
I was worried.

01:09:05.057 --> 01:09:06.475
That's why I came,

01:09:07.685 --> 01:09:09.395
but you came here to watch the game.

01:09:10.729 --> 01:09:11.981
Right?

01:09:13.107 --> 01:09:14.942
Yes, that's what I said.

01:09:18.028 --> 01:09:19.113
Why ask me twice?

01:09:19.947 --> 01:09:20.823
Bye.

01:09:24.118 --> 01:09:26.662
Why does it have to be Lim Ju-kyung,
you idiot?

01:09:29.957 --> 01:09:31.000
Hey, Soo-ho!

01:09:40.259 --> 01:09:41.135
You're right.

01:09:41.844 --> 01:09:44.430
I'm here for Lim Ju-kyung
and not for the game.

01:09:48.809 --> 01:09:50.603
Is there a reason why I shouldn't?

01:10:15.044 --> 01:10:17.838
THANK YOU TO JUNG GUN-JOO
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:10:44.323 --> 01:10:46.325
You two have matching outfits.

01:10:46.408 --> 01:10:48.994
Are you going to surprise us
with news that you're dating?

01:10:49.078 --> 01:10:52.289
- Date!
- Date!

01:10:52.373 --> 01:10:53.999
There's someone you like.

01:10:54.500 --> 01:10:56.335
Why were you avoiding me today?

01:10:56.418 --> 01:10:58.462
No, I wasn't avoiding you.

01:11:02.549 --> 01:11:04.176
Why does it have to be Lim Ju-kyung?

01:11:04.260 --> 01:11:05.261
I have no idea!

01:11:05.344 --> 01:11:06.929
Why it has to be her.

01:11:08.430 --> 01:11:09.974
Why are you crying over him?

01:11:10.933 --> 01:11:12.476
Is it because you like him?

01:11:13.936 --> 01:11:18.941
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
